{"unit_id":"imchangchang__dsh-llm-provider#card-zh","repo":"imchangchang/dsh-llm-provider","commit":"4dfdc7ada6210641bdda43ed2b7a67bc7393ace1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-provider 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型供应商管理插件。它通过 bundle patch 接管内置模型适配器，并桥接 pi-ai 模型目录；同时注册模型选择座位、Provider 设置页和 /model 命令。用户可以管理供应商路由、选择模型与推理强度、查看账户额度，并通过 OAuth 或设备码流程登录支持的供应商。适合需要在 DSH 中统一管理多家模型服务的用户；额度查询使用对应供应商的账户凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:121","cordis.patch.yml:1","src/client/index.ts:146","src/client/command.ts:37"]}
{"unit_id":"imchangchang__dsh-llm-provider#card-en","repo":"imchangchang/dsh-llm-provider","commit":"4dfdc7ada6210641bdda43ed2b7a67bc7393ace1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-llm-provider manages DSH model providers. It replaces built-in adapters, adds a model selector and Provider settings page, and provides the /model command. Users can edit provider routes, check quotas, and use OAuth sign-in where supported.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:121","cordis.patch.yml:1","src/client/index.ts:146","src/client/command.ts:37"]}
